re</a>, introduced in <a href=3D"https://aclanthology.org/P02-1040.pdf" rel=
=3D"nofollow">a 2002 article</a> by Kishore Papineni et al. The BLEU score =
evaluates how close the translations are to their labels. It does not measu=
re the intelligibility or grammatical correctness of the model=E2=80=99s ge=
nerated outputs, but uses statistical rules to ensure that all the words in=
